Featuring a rugged dark grey and industrial yellow paint scheme, "Striker" stands out immediately due to its massive pneumatic jackhammers attached to both forearms. These high-powered pulverizing gauntlets can deliver rapid, high-frequency kinetic strikes capable of shattering concrete, clearing heavy debris, or standing up to extreme acoustic vibrations without damaging the pilot.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXV gets a standout moment during the House Party Protocol battle at the Norco oil rig: it slams its pneumatic jackhammer arms into the ground to create shockwaves and pulverize gantry platforms under two Extremis soldiers, sending them falling into the bay below before ultimately being destroyed in the "Clean Slate" detonation.
